WEBVTT
# Subtitles for Star Catcher EP3

00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:15.000
Something arrived overnight. Water sheets off the black glass.

00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:20.000
It does not move.

00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:23.800
It does not need to.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:35.800
Spring, summer, autumn, winter.

00:00:37.400 --> 00:00:41.500
Each season, a year gone.

00:00:44.600 --> 00:00:49.500
Each year, only a single step closer.

00:01:28.900 --> 00:01:32.500
The Mother descends to read the tide.

00:01:33.900 --> 00:01:36.800
Her constellation redraws itself.

00:01:38.900 --> 00:01:43.000
The Catcher, and holding his hand...

00:01:45.300 --> 00:01:47.000
...someone small.

00:01:58.500 --> 00:02:01.500
He touches the reflection.

00:02:03.000 --> 00:02:06.000
A vision of fire and glass.

00:02:08.200 --> 00:02:15.500
He remembers now, or he is being told.

00:02:19.300 --> 00:02:21.500
It is hard to know the difference.

00:02:37.500 --> 00:02:43.000
The monolith climbs toward the zenith. Lanterns swarm the peak.

00:02:51.900 --> 00:02:54.500
Someone is coming back.
